Special thanks to Chris Lawrence, who's xanim-modules installer provided
inspiration for this package.

The full text of the GPL is available in /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL

This package is not part of the Debian GNU/Linux system but located in
the contrib section. This is because it installs fonts which are not 
under a free licence.

This version of the installer uses local font files (sourced from Windows 11) 
provided during the build process and does not require internet connectivity.

For licensing terms for the fonts themselves, please read the READ_ME!.gz
file located (after installation) in /usr/share/doc/ttf-mscorefonts-installer
